  "description": "HotChocolate.Data support for AdCodicem value objects: every value object a filter meets is filtered through the comparable operations of its GraphQL scalar, its operands read through its rules and a refused one answered with the rule's code, translated to its column by Entity Framework Core, with no binding per type; contains, startsWith and endsWith over the underlying text on request. AOT-compatible code; HotChocolate.Data's filtering itself does not run natively.",
